WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.464
A function is only useful if it works.

2
00:00:03.464 --> 00:00:08.125
In this lesson, you will learn to write functions with one or two inputs,

3
00:00:08.125 --> 00:00:13.120
test them with the Invoke button, and apply them to a whole table. Let's practice!

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.747
I start a new blank query and call it Sum.

5
00:00:18.747 --> 00:00:22.868
The function begins with its inputs in brackets, then the arrow.

6
00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:26.240
As you type, IntelliSense suggests functions you can use.

7
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.738
Here is our earlier function at work in the Financial Sample:

8
00:00:43.738 --> 00:00:46.820
a new column, Amin, calculated for every row.

9
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:02.142
In Invoke Custom Function, you name the new column, choose the function, and pick

10
00:01:02.142 --> 00:01:03.800
a column for each input.

11
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.086
Now a function with one input: Amin, arrow, Amin.

12
00:01:13.086 --> 00:01:15.874
Power Query shows an Enter Parameters form.

13
00:01:15.874 --> 00:01:19.460
Type a value, click Invoke, and see the result.

14
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:29.400
With two inputs, Amin and Ali, the function can add them: Amin plus Ali.

15
00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.500
The form now has two boxes.

16
00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:44.034
Here I test it with ten and two, and the answer appears as a

17
00:01:44.034 --> 00:01:45.653
new query called Invoked Function.

18
00:01:45.653 --> 00:01:47.920
Testing like this is quick and safe.

19
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:23.159
Back in the table, I invoke a function on two columns.

20
00:02:23.159 --> 00:02:27.150
If the inputs do not match the column types, you get errors.

21
00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:28.480
Check your types first.

22
00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:03.380
I test another version with the values twenty three and thirty two.

23
00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.909
Functions can do text work too.

24
00:03:21.909 --> 00:03:25.925
Here, Text dot Lower turns any text into lower case.

25
00:03:25.925 --> 00:03:29.940
Small tools like these save hours of cleaning. Excellent work!

